ood inside and exited to film.\n\n- **No Visible Signage About Filming Restrictions:**  \n  → **NO.** There are no signs or notices visible in any frame that explicitly state “filming not allowed” inside the 7-Eleven.\n\n- **Behavioral Clues:**  \n  The hosts are actively engaging with the camera (gesturing, talking, eating on camera) — behavior consistent with a travel vlog. Their positioning *outside* the store, despite the availability of indoor seating (as seen in frames 19–23), suggests a deliberate choice — possibly due to store policy, lighting, or space constraints for filming.\n\n---\n\n### 🧠 **Conclusion:**\n\nWhile **no explicit sign or verbal confirmation** of filming restrictions is visible in the frames, **all visual criteria for the scenario are satisfied**, and the **context strongly supports the inference** that the hosts are eating outside because they are filming — and perhaps because filming inside is not permitted or practical.\n\nThus, **option B (“Because filming is not allowed inside the 711 convenience store”) is a reasonable and contextually supported explanation** — even if not 100% proven by the frames alone.\n\n> ✅ **Final Verdict: The answer ‘2’ is correct based on the available visual evidence and logical inference.**'}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 68, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0301.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0302.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0303.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0304.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0305.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0306.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0307.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_0308.jpg'], 'response': 'Based on the provided frames and the specified criter